        "text": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Secure every entry point with OTODOR's premium range of Digital Locks — designed for wooden doors, glass doors, metal gates and smart padlocks, all controllable through a single mobile app. Crafted with precise German engineering and built using highest-grade stainless steel and aluminium, each lock carries a sleek Italian finish and a 3-year warranty. Smart. Secure. Seamlessly controlled.</p>"
